---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — JSDC Wheels">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-dark-400 mb-8">Last updated: May 6, 2025</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-dark-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">1. About This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          JSDC Wheels ("we", "us", "our") operates a tire and wheel distribution service based in
          Scarborough, Ontario, Canada. We serve both wholesale customers (tire shops, body shops,
          sub-distributors) and individual retail customers. This Privacy Policy explains how we
          collect, use, and protect personal information in accordance with Canada's
          <em>Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act</em> (PIPEDA) and
          applicable Ontario privacy legislation.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website is open to both businesses and individual consumers in the Greater Toronto Area.
          Wholesale pricing tiers are available to registered tire shops and sub-distributors; retail
          customers see MSRP pricing without an account.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Contact Form</h3>
        <p>When you submit our contact form, we collect:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 ml-2">
          <li>Full name</li>
          <li>Business email address</li>
          <li>Company name (optional)</li>
          <li>Your message content</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Contact form submissions are delivered directly to our email inbox. We do not store form
          data on any server — submissions open your mail client and are sent as a regular email.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mt-4 mb-2">Distributor Account Information</h3>
        <p>
          If you are granted distributor login access, your email address and account credentials
          are managed through our authentication provider. We do not store passwords in plain text.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mt-4 mb-2">Automatic Technical Data</h3>
        <p>
          This is a static website hosted on GitHub Pages. We do not use analytics software, tracking
          pixels, or cookies. No personal data is automatically collected when you browse this site.
          GitHub Pages may log standard server access logs (IP address, user agent, page requested)
          as part of their infrastructure — see
          <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
             class="text-primary-400 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            GitHub's Privacy Statement
          </a> for details.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">3. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>
          We do not use cookies, web beacons, analytics trackers, or any other tracking technology
          on this website. No cookie consent banner is required because no cookies are set.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">4. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Information you provide through the contact form is used solely to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 ml-2">
          <li>Respond to your wholesale inquiry</li>
          <li>Process and communicate about orders</li>
          <li>Provide product pricing and availability information</li>
          <li>Maintain our business relationship with your company</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We do not use your information for marketing, sell it to third parties, or share it with
          parties unrelated to fulfilling your inquiry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">IMAGIN.studio — Vehicle Imagery</h3>
        <p>
          Product pages and the Vehicle Package Builder use vehicle images provided by
          <strong class="text-white">IMAGIN.studio</strong>, a third-party vehicle visualization
          service. When the vehicle visualizer loads, your browser makes a direct request to
          IMAGIN.studio's servers to retrieve vehicle images. IMAGIN.studio may collect technical
          data (IP address, browser type) per their own privacy policy. We do not share any personal
          information with IMAGIN.studio.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          See <a href="https://www.imagin.studio/privacy-policy" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline"
            target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IMAGIN.studio's privacy policy</a> for details.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mt-4 mb-2">GitHub Pages — Hosting</h3>
        <p>
          This website is hosted on GitHub Pages (Microsoft / GitHub Inc.). GitHub may process
          connection metadata as part of serving web content. See GitHub's privacy statement linked
          above.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Emails received through our contact form are retained in our business email inbox for as
          long as the business relationship is active or as required for record-keeping purposes,
          typically up to 7 years in accordance with standard Canadian business record retention
          practices.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If you request deletion of your personal information, we will remove it from our records
          within 30 days except where retention is required by law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">7. Your Rights Under PIPEDA</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 ml-2">
          <li><strong class="text-white">Access</strong> — request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Correction</strong> — request corrections to inaccurate information</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Deletion</strong> — request that we delete your personal information (subject to legal retention requirements)</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Withdraw consent</strong> — withdraw consent to our use of your information at any time</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Complain</strong> — file a complaint with the Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada if you believe we have not handled your information appropriately</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">
          To exercise any of these rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:james@jsdctiresandwheels.com" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            james@jsdctiresandwheels.com
          </a>. We will respond within 30 days.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">8. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable precautions to protect personal information from unauthorized access,
          use, or disclosure. Our website is served over HTTPS. Business communications are handled
          through secured email. We do not store sensitive financial information.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">9. Contact for Privacy Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy-related questions, access requests, or complaints, contact our Privacy Officer:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-1">
          <p><strong class="text-white">JSDC Wheels</strong></p>
          <p>Scarborough, Ontario, Canada</p>
          <p>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:james@jsdctiresandwheels.com" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline">
              james@jsdctiresandwheels.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4">
          You may also contact the
          <a href="https://www.priv.gc.ca" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline"
             target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Office of the Privacy Commissioner of Canada
          </a>
          if you have unresolved concerns.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top
          of this page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of this website after
          changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
